as running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also failed in staging.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy in production. All three regions now run it, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure and the rollback, and recommends finding the root cause before v2.3.1 is deployed again. Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}